# onnxruntime-node 1.21.0 tries to download its CUDA (GPU) add-on on Linux x64 during npm ci.
# That GitHub download now answers 404 (18 Nov 2026), which stopped the PR 432 release on a
# fresh install. The app uses the CPU build inside the npm package, so the GPU add-on is skipped.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
